OL,3,GNEWSACarnival clean-up removes 300
OL,4,Atonnes of waste
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 300 tonnes of waste have been
OL,7,Fcleared from the streets of North
OL,8,FKensington after the Notting Hill
OL,9,FCarnival in an overnight operation
OL,10,Finvolving about 200 staff and 30 waste
OL,11,Fvehicles.
OL,13,FMore than two million people joined the
OL,14,Fcarnival's 60th anniversary
OL,15,Fcelebrations, and as the festivities
OL,16,Fdrew to a close a clean-up began to get
OL,17,Fthe area back to normal, Kensington and
OL,18,FChelsea Council said.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
