OL,3,GNEWSACarnival clean-up removes 300
OL,4,Atonnes of waste
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said the overnight shifts
OL,7,Fwere designed to reopen roads and
OL,8,Fpavements and allow residents to get
OL,9,Fback to normal.
OL,11,FAbout 30% of the waste collected is
OL,12,Fexpected to be recycled.
